[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0100","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2857","title":"Joomla! Music Manager 组件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Music Manager 组件存在目录遍历（本地文件包含）漏洞（CWE-22）。该组件在处理 album.html 页面时未对 cid 参数进行充分过滤，远程攻击者可通过在 cid 参数中注入 \"../\"（点点点）目录遍历序列，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、密码哈希等敏感数据），并可能借此造成其他未明确的危害。该漏洞影响使用存在缺陷的 Music Manager 组件的所有 Joomla! 站点，攻击者在无需身份认证的情况下即可通过构造特制请求远程发起攻击，CVSS 评分为 6.8，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2857"],"sources":["nuclei","exploit-db","cve"],"published":"2010-07-24T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载或禁用存在漏洞的 Joomla! Music Manager 第三方组件；若必须继续使用，请在组件 album.html 中对 cid 参数使用 intval() 强制取整并过滤 \"../\" 等路径穿越字符，同时升级到官方已修复该缺陷的版本。临时缓解措施包括在 Joomla 全局配置中将 PHP 的 allow_url_include 设为 Off，并将组件目录文件权限设为只读。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1007-exploits/joomlamusicmanager-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14274","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41485","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/60195","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2857.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0308","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2568","title":"Microsoft Windows LNK 快捷方式文件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Shell 在处理 .LNK 和 .PIF 快捷方式文件的图标显示时存在远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意的快捷方式文件（如放置在 U 盘或网络共享中），当 Windows Explorer 自动解析其图标时触发漏洞，无需用户额外交互即可执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows XP SP3、Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP1/SP2、Server 2008 SP2/R2 及 Windows 7 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高危。2010 年 7 月已被在野利用，Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS10-046 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2568"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-07-22T05:43:49Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:20:59Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS10-046 (KB2286198) 补丁，该补丁修复了 Windows Shell 处理 .LNK 和 .PIF 快捷方式文件时的图标显示漏洞。临时缓解措施包括：禁用 WebClient 服务、在防火墙阻止 TCP 139/445 端口、禁用自动播放功能，以及通过组策略限制用户安装未签名 ActiveX 控件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://isc.sans.edu/diary.html?storyid=9181","http://isc.sans.edu/diary.html?storyid=9190","http://krebsonsecurity.com/2010/07/experts-warn-of-new-windows-shortcut-flaw/","http://secunia.com/advisories/40647","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024216","http://www.f-secure.com/weblog/archives/00001986.html","http://www.f-secure.com/weblog/archives/new_rootkit_en.pdf","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/940193","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/advisory/2286198.mspx","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41732","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-222A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-046","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A11564","https://www.geoffchappell.com/notes/security/stuxnet/ctrlfldr.htm","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-2568","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16574","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-2568.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2568.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-2568.rules","https://github.com/FuzzySecurity/PowerShell-Suite/blob/720d8fe82396faf74f2ca19a3fe99a5c262a14b9/Export-LNKPwn.ps1","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2568.json","https://github.com/MahdiHedhli/threatpedia/blob/9c95c1bcbb7ff89eda6c0a2154702b1ad72592e4/site/src/content/zero-days/stuxnet-lnk-shortcut-cve-2010-2568.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2010-2568.txt","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/md/%E9%9C%87%E7%BD%91%20Stuxnet%20%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.md","https://github.com/cwbae10-purdue/CTI-EACL24/blob/5990586483b6ba4c7e6eef0ddb1c3698a740308b/threat-reports-large/eset/data/866_a-few-facts-about-win32stuxnet-cve-2010-2568.txt","https://github.com/lprat/static_file_analysis/blob/88f4b3a1811a9db67278b2783276807c8c3e1f44/yara_rules1/lnk.yar"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0099","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2682","title":"Joomla Realtyna Translator 组件 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Realtyna Translator（com_realtyna）组件 1.0.15 存在目录遍历（任意文件读取/本地文件包含）漏洞。该组件在处理 index.php 的 controller 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤校验，攻击者可构造包含「../」（点-点-斜杠）序列的恶意参数，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、源码等敏感信息），甚至可能进一步造成本地文件包含等其他影响。该漏洞影响使用 com_realtyna 1.0.15 组件的 Joomla! 站点，远程未经身份认证的攻击者仅需发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可利用，无需任何权限或用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2682"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-07-12T13:27:28Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Realtyna Translator (com_realtyna) 组件至官方修复版本，或卸载/禁用该组件（Extensions → Manage → Disable）；无法立即升级时，在 Web 应用防火墙或 .htaccess 中拦截 index.php?option=com_realtyna 请求中包含「../」的 controller 参数，并限制 PHP 对网站目录及系统文件的读取权限以缓解任意文件读取风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1004-exploits/joomlarealtyna-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14017","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/39337","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/57647","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14017","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2682.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0098","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2680","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16353,\"outputTokens\":36,\"totalTokens\":16389}}","description":"Joomla! 的 JExtensions JE Section/Property Finder（jesectionfinder）组件存在目录遍历漏洞。该组件在处理 index.php 的 view 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤，远程攻击者可在 view 参数中插入 \"../\" 等目录遍历序列，从而包含并执行目标服务器上的任意本地文件。攻击无需身份认证，仅需向受影响站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发，可导致敏感信息泄露甚至远程代码执行。受影响范围为安装了该缺陷组件的 Joomla! 站点，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2680"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-07-12T13:27:27Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:15Z","remediation":"建议立即在 Joomla! 后台 Extensions→Manage 中卸载或禁用存在漏洞的 jesectionfinder 组件，该第三方商业扩展官方已不再维护且无安全更新；若必须保留使用，应修补 components/com_jesectionfinder/ 下对 view 参数的处理代码，改用 JInput 获取输入并配合 basename() 或白名单机制仅允许加载预设视图文件，严禁解析含 \"../\" 的目录遍历序列；作为临时缓解，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache 的 .htaccess 或 Nginx 的 rewrite 规则）中拦截对 /component/jesectionfinder/ 路径中含 \"../\" 或 null 字节的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1006-exploits/joomlajesectionfinder-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14064","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41163","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/59796","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14064","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2680.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-2680.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2680.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-2680.js","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6470123a7d8a7a3e512a294dd5d252afb3fc5a2/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-26xx/CVE-2010-2680.json","https://github.com/0xAwali/Virtual-Host/blob/a2988987751a6ab1f30d71e0d002b7af148c5c79/Templates/CVE/CVE-2010-2680.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-2680-1955.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-2680.rules","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/cve-2010-2680-1959.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/889686929cb8269a754b7b9536317f741fc92ddc/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2680.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-2680_28.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0098.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0097","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2507","title":"Joomla! Picasa2Gallery 组件本地文件包含漏洞（LFI）","description":"Picasa2Gallery（com_picasa2gallery）组件 1.2.8 及更早版本存在目录遍历（本地文件包含）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 的 controller 参数传入包含 ../ 的路径序列，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd），并可能包含并执行本地文件造成进一步影响。攻击仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求，无需认证，利用条件为开启该组件且 PHP 未有效禁用空字节截断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2507"],"sources":["nuclei","cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2010-06-28T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Picasa2Gallery 组件到官方修复版本，或在 index.php 入口过滤 controller 参数中的 ../ 及空字节（%00），并配置 Joomla! 全局输入过滤以阻止目录遍历。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T18:42:14Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2010-2507","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/13981","http://secunia.com/advisories/40297","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41031","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/59669","http://packetstormsecurity.org/1006-exploits/joomlapicasa2gallery-lfi.txt"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/13981","http://packetstormsecurity.org/1006-exploits/joomlapicasa2gallery-lfi.txt"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/13981"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0175","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1769","title":"Apple iTunes WebKit 表格处理越界内存访问远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iTunes 9.2 之前版本（Windows 平台）及 Apple iOS 4 之前版本（iPhone/iPod touch）中集成的 WebKit 引擎在处理 HTML 表格时存在越界内存访问漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制 HTML 文档，通过诱导用户访问恶意网页触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。CVSS 评分 10.0，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1769"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-18T16:30:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:19:17Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple iTunes 升级至 9.2 或更高版本（Windows 平台），iPhone/iPod touch 用户升级至 iOS 4 或更高版本。该漏洞在 iTunes 9.2 及 iOS 4 中已修复，通过 Apple Software Update 或 iTunes 内置更新功能即可获取。无法升级时，避免在受影响设备上打开不可信的 HTML 文档或网页。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Jun/msg00002.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-01/msg00006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/40196","http://secunia.com/advisories/43068","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024108","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4220","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4225","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41016","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1512","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0212","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/59508","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A7178","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2010/1xxx/CVE-2010-1769.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-1769","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2010/CVE-2010-1387.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-1769.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2010-1769","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-59px-m78w-3rc3/GHSA-59px-m78w-3rc3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-1769.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/itunes_9_2.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/secpod_apple_itunes_mult_unspecified_vuln.nasl","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2010-1763"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0175.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0173","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0173.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1763","title":"Apple iTunes WebKit 未指定漏洞","description":"标签中。<value>Apple iTunes 9.2 之前版本中集成的 WebKit 引擎存在未指定漏洞，该漏洞可能被远程攻击者利用，通过构造恶意网页或诱使用户处理特制文件来触发。成功利用此漏洞可能导致应用程序崩溃或任意代码执行，进而完全控制受影响的系统。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 iTunes 软件，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，属于严重级别安全风险。Apple 已在 iTunes 9.2 版本中修复了此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1763"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-18T16:30:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:19:16Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apple iTunes 至 9.2 或更高版本。Windows