0（中危），影响固件版本 SBV6X2X-1.0.0.5-SCM-02-SHPC 的 Motorola SURFBoard SBV6120E 设备。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2307"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-06-16T20:30:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:20:30Z","remediation":"建议联系运营商（ISP）推送或升级 Motorola SURFBoard SBV6120E 至修复该目录遍历漏洞的新版固件（高于受影响的 SBV6X2X-1.0.0.5-SCM-02-SHPC 版本）；过渡期间在边界防火墙或路由器上配置 ACL，禁止从 WAN 侧及公网访问设备管理地址（默认 192.168.100.1 的 80 端口），仅放行受信任的内网主机，并关闭设备不必要的远程 Web 管理功能以阻断 `///`、`../` 及编码形式的任意文件读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/40054","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12865","http://www.osvdb.org/65249","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40550","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/59113","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12865","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2307.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-2307.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2307.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-2307.js","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2010-2307-1943.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-2307-1947.yaml","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2307.json","https://github.com/Kaiz7703/My_Tools/blob/a1512a65d2b2896963bf459cd1edcdab0a9bdcba/nuclei-waf-testing/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2307.yaml","https://github.com/PetiteTaupe/automation-cve-testing/blob/8fbac77a20cb4af865eac2393918d158f1941817/data/raw/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2307.json","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs_dev/nucleibak/cves/2010/CVE-2010-2307.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-2307_17.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0182","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0182.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2264","title":"Apple Safari WebKit CSS :visited 伪类信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 浏览器中 WebKit 引擎的 CSS 实现未能正确处理 :visited 伪类，攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 文档，利用 CSS 样式查询机制探测用户已访问过的网站链接。该漏洞属于信息泄露类型，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，但需要用户使用受影响的 Safari 浏览器访问恶意页面。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.4/10.5/10.6 及 Windows 平台上的 Safari 4.1 以下及 5.0 以下版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2264"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-11T19:30:23Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:20:25Z","remediation":"升级 Apple Safari 至 5.0 及以上版本（Mac OS X 10.5~10.6 及 Windows 平台）或 4.1 及以上版本（Mac OS X 10.4 平台），该更新修复了 WebKit 中 CSS :visited 伪类导致的信息泄露问题。如无法立即升级，可禁用 JavaScript 或使用无痕浏览模式作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010/Jun/msg00000.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-01/msg00006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/40105","http://secunia.com/advisories/41856","http://secunia.com/advisories/43068","http://securitytracker.com/id?1024067","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4196","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:039","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40620","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40756","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1006-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1373","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2722","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0212","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0552","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f5