e/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-1771.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-2302.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_fedora_2011_1224_webkitgtk_fc13.nasl","https://github.com/openSUSE/news-o-o/blob/f00a24fa16e9d957a04b4b8d47c2090853697549/_posts/2010/2010-08-22-opensuse-weekly-news-issue-137-is-out.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0177.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0176","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0176.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-1770","title":"Apple Safari 和 Google Chrome WebKit 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 和 Google Chrome 使用的 WebKit 引擎在处理包含 IBM1147 字符集的文本节点转换时存在类型检查缺陷，远程攻击者可通过构造包含特殊 BR 元素的 HTML 文档触发内存破坏，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.4~10.6 及 Windows 平台上的 Safari 5.0 以下版本以及 Chrome 5.0.375.70 以下版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。用户需升级至 Safari 5.0/4.1 或 Chrome 5.0.375.70 以上版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-1770"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-06-11T19:30:20Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:19:17Z","remediation":"Mac OS X 10.5/10.6 及 Windows 用户将 Safari 升级至 5.0 或更高版本，Mac OS X 10.4 用户升级至 Safari 4.1；Google Chrome 用户升级至 5.0.375.70 或更高版本；Ubuntu 用户运行 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade libwebkit 安装 USN-1006-1 安全更新；openSUSE 用户安装 2011 年 1 月发布的 webkit-gtk 安全补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=43487","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2010/06/stable-channel-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Jun/msg00002.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Sep/msg00002.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/201